 "A tour of every menu": "help:menus-tour",
 "After giving up you see **Level failed**, with how close you came (“So close!”, “Almost there!” or “Not this time”) and whether a life was used. Choose **Try again**, or **Back to the map**. From level 6 you can start the next try with a head start: a Rocket on the board and a free UFO, for 800 coins.": "help:lives-moves-and-undos",
 "An L, T or + shape.": "help:bricks-specials-and-blockers",
 "Any moves you have left turn into line blasters and go off, adding 150 points each. Tap to skip the show.": "help:welcome",
