 "Level 31 on the beach: 16 moves left, goals of 8 yellow and 8 blue. Big joined bricks are stacked at the bottom of the board: a long blue bar, a tall blue column and a yellow piece bent into a C, with blue and yellow gates on the edges.": "help:bricks-specials-and-blockers · help:blockers-encyclopedia · help:board-kinds",
