 "Out of Lives: 0 of 5 lives and a countdown to the next one, then unlimited lives for 1 hour, 3 hours or 24 hours, for coins or money, a Refill for 600 coins, Watch for a life, and OK. A note at the foot says a life is only lost when a board is lost, lives come back one every 30 minutes, and once a day an empty tank gets a free attempt.": "help:lives-moves-and-undos · help:rewards-and-ads",
