 "The **order panel** at the top shows what this board wants and how many are left: bricks of a colour to send home or match, crates to break, locks to undo or moss to clear. Each goal wears the same colour-blind symbol as its bricks. Some boards come in two **stages**: finish the first goals and new gates open for the second.": "help:welcome",
